{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415674","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415674","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1041567401:1":{"text":"あなたが書いた、オルディン村の投資計画を読みました。ずいぶんあの村に期待しているようですね。","source_cn":"我看到你这次对深岩村进行的投资方案了，你看好那边的发展？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB37FCF2EE9D37252","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041567402:1":{"text":"ええ。実地調査も行いましたからね。ちょっとしたトラブルはありましたが、見込みは十分あると思いますよ。","source_cn":"当然，我实地去考察过，尽管遭遇了一些事故，但总体而言前...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B509AA6CC355FE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041567403:1":{"text":"もちろん、全部を独占しようとは思っていませんよ。ミスリル商会も参入するおつもりで？","source_cn":"我没想过占据全部的份额，所以秘银商会打算加入吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFBFB5EF82029946","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041567404:1":{"text":"ええ、そのつもりですが、商会名義ではありません。","source_cn":"我确实有这个打算，不过不是以秘银商会的名义。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBDABC0791725ADEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041567405:1":{"text":"まずは個人で参入する予定です。今のオイラではまだ、商会の決定を左右するほどの影響力はありませんから。","source_cn":"应该是我以私人名义先行进入，毕竟我还无法完全影响秘银商...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1994855F702AA103","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041567406:1":{"text":"ほう。つまり、金麦村に提供した投資計画のような？","source_cn":"就像你对金穗村提供的投资方案一样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB60D6623D65AA53D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041567407:1":{"text":"いやはや、あの時の君の胆力には驚きましたよ。","source_cn":"我现在还非常惊叹于你当时的胆量。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB940EAB779BC344D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041567408:1":{"text":"当時、金麦村の一番の問題は小麦の生産量で、事業環境は二の次でしたからね。","source_cn":"金穗村当时困扰我的最大根源其实是小麦的产量，其次才是营...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x204CBF0FA0ECB821","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041567409:1":{"text":"生産量を確保できれば、環境面はあとからどうにでもなると思ったんです。","source_cn":"在确保产量后，后续的环境其实很好处理。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62BA13BCF7F31359","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041567410:1":{"text":"それに、実際にこの目で見て状況を把握していたので、大まかな予想はついていました。","source_cn":"本质上还是因为，当时我正在实地走访，所以一切发展都心中有数。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB96CC0472B07A8AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041567411:1":{"text":"だから、投資計画をまとめることができたんですよ。","source_cn":"所以才敢整理出方案进行投资。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE9E5E14C1EDAC55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041567412:1":{"text":"やはり、どんな大胆な判断も、それを支えるだけの情報と認識があってこそ成り立つものですね。","source_cn":"果然，无论怎样的大胆，前提都得是自身建立起足够的认知，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E92A808C507B065","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041567413:1":{"text":"あなたこそ。大富豪のバハラムさんが、自ら現場の視察に出向くなんて、誰も信じませんよ。","source_cn":"你也一样，很难有人相信奢华的富商巴赫朗会有耐性一个个去...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B9A6BEAC64B78A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041567414:1":{"text":"ははっ、単に家にいるのが退屈で、気分転換しようと思っただけかもしれませんよ？","source_cn":"或许我也只是在家待得无聊了，想换换环境呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16C3F69166F69526","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:罗万":{"text":"ロワン","source":"罗万","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:巴赫朗":{"text":"バハラム","source":"巴赫朗","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":15,"localized_text_count":14,"speaker_count":2}}